&lt;col style="width:13.6pt;min-width:13.6pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:80.3pt;min-width:80.3pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:13.6pt;min-width:13.6pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:95.3pt;min-width:95.3pt;"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:10.9pt;min-height:10.9pt;"&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;調整後払込金額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;＝&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;調整前払込金額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;×&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="bottom"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;１&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:10.9pt;min-height:10.9pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;分割・併合の比率&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;　　また、新株予約権の割当日後に時価を下回る価額で新株式の発行または自己株式の処分を行う場合は、次の算式により払込金額を調整し、調整により生ずる１円未満の端数は切り上げる。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;
