&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;"&gt;【関連当事者情報】&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;１．関連当事者との取引&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(1) 連結財務諸表提出会社と関連当事者の取引&lt;/p&gt;
